grader right now and say you're

00:22:35.988 --> 00:22:37.823
going to become a
world-class surfer--

00:22:37.823 --> 00:22:39.358
- If he wants to be.

00:22:39.358 --> 00:22:42.094
- if he or she wants to be than
you'll think they'll become a

00:22:42.094 --> 00:22:43.462
world-class surfer?

00:22:43.462 --> 00:22:44.530
- That's so tough.

00:22:44.530 --> 00:22:47.233
I think they'll find
their career in surfing.

00:22:47.233 --> 00:22:50.669
I think that's a logical great
decision that six-year-old.

00:22:50.669 --> 00:22:52.771
- And you're saying that because
you found your career in the

00:22:52.771 --> 00:22:56.075
music industry whether or not
you were trying manage or not.

00:22:56.075 --> 00:22:57.733
- The thing is the guy before,
the first question

00:22:57.733 --> 00:22:59.078
he was asking about--

00:22:59.078 --> 00:23:01.378
- Nobody wants to be a manager
when they want to be a star.

00:23:01.378 --> 00:23:03.156
- I do.
- No, now.

00:23:03.156 --> 00:23:05.384
- Oh yeah.
- When you were 11--

00:23:05.384 --> 00:23:07.786
- I believed in them more than 
I believed in myself so that was

00:23:07.786 --> 00:23:08.487
the turning point.

00:23:08.487 --> 00:23:10.162
- Because they had talent.
- Yeah. They're good.

00:23:10.162 --> 00:23:11.690
- I think that that's the point.

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:14.093
I really mean that because you
have to understand where I'm

00:23:14.093 --> 00:23:16.662
coming from and where my energy
is coming from. Right now we are

00:23:16.662 --> 00:23:20.299
looking to the greatest era
of fake entrepreneurs ever.

00:23:20.299 --> 00:23:24.503
Every single person that is
under 25 is coming out of school

00:23:24.503 --> 00:23:26.105
and they're like,
"I'm an app founder."

00:23:26.105 --> 00:23:28.974
I'm sure you talk to these
people everybody's a fucking

00:23:28.974 --> 00:23:31.944
entrepreneur and they just think
because they've said it and

00:23:31.944 --> 00:23:34.914
