entrepreneur and that's the key.

00:23:38.050 --> 00:23:39.652
Which is you can be anything.

00:23:39.652 --> 00:23:42.354
Do I believe if I put in 10,000
hours into surfing that

00:23:42.354 --> 00:23:44.123
I'd be a good surfer?
I sure do.

00:23:44.123 --> 00:23:46.292
Do I think I could 
win the competitions

00:23:46.292 --> 00:23:47.293
