00:23:47.293 --> 00:23:47.960
No, I do not.

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:51.530
I think there is a secondary
thing that has to happen.

00:23:51.530 --> 00:23:53.032
Look at the NBA.

00:23:53.032 --> 00:23:57.437
You mentioned Adele, what
about the 12th man on the Heat.

00:23:57.437 --> 00:23:58.137
Right?

00:23:58.137 --> 00:24:01.738
He's one of the best 300
basketball players in the world

00:24:01.738 --> 00:24:05.010
