EDM and hip hop music right this

00:24:21.527 --> 00:24:24.797
second and so many of them
can't succeed in the marketplace

00:24:24.797 --> 00:24:26.965
'cause the talent is a variable.

00:24:26.965 --> 00:24:28.267
I really do believe that.

00:24:28.267 --> 00:24:30.803
I just don't see how one
doesn't understand that.

00:24:30.803 --> 00:24:32.137
There's so many
people that want it.

00:24:32.137 --> 00:24:34.973
There are so many people that
put in those hours in so many

00:24:34.973 --> 00:24:37.910
things and especially in music
and sports which are very high

00:24:37.910 --> 00:24:42.341
glossy, exciting things to be in
society like I don't know.

00:24:42.341 --> 00:24:45.651
I'm fascinated by the talent
conversation because I think it

00:24:45.651 --> 00:24:46.919
is a dangerous conversation

00:24:46.919 --> 00:24:49.188
because I was picking
and prodding.

00:24:49.188 --> 00:24:51.657
The reason I'm in a good mood
as you're talking a lot more now

00:24:51.657 --> 00:24:53.025
