what we have so much depression

00:25:00.833 --> 00:25:03.369
and other things that people
don't everybody was a "rah-rah."

00:25:03.369 --> 00:25:04.503
Everybody wants you can do it.

00:25:04.503 --> 00:25:06.972
Nobody understands that when
they don't do it what happens

00:25:06.972 --> 00:25:08.340
that kid's psyche.
- Mhmmm.

00:25:08.340 --> 00:25:11.677
- I think part of being a
successful young person is you

00:25:11.677 --> 00:25:14.179
get the opportunity
to make those pivots.

00:25:14.179 --> 00:25:17.082
You get the opportunity to say,
"Okay I'm in eighth place maybe

00:25:17.082 --> 00:25:17.916
"I should become a coach.

00:25:17.916 --> 00:25:19.685
"Maybe I should change
my career progression."

00:25:19.685 --> 00:25:23.122
- When you're getting the
direction that you can still do

00:25:23.122 --> 00:25:26.825
