dealing with what I think

00:25:32.197 --> 00:25:33.933
the mental health issues that 
are not being talked about

00:25:33.933 --> 00:25:36.156
where everybody all of a sudden 
after 50 years of prosperity

00:25:36.156 --> 00:25:40.313
in America thinks that they're 
going to become Adele and LeBron

00:25:40.313 --> 00:25:42.241
and they don't and 
then they're baffled.

00:25:42.241 --> 00:25:47.146
- Do you think that when you
talk about the 10,000 hour rule

00:25:47.146 --> 00:25:49.848
