it, do you think part of that is

00:25:49.848 --> 00:25:51.784
the equation is
perseverance though?

00:25:51.784 --> 00:25:56.221
You should have heard the songs
we wrote back in a day and we

00:25:56.221 --> 00:25:59.958
still write to this day and I
could have checked out and said,

00:25:59.958 --> 00:26:01.226
"Hey, I just don't have talent."

00:26:01.226 --> 00:26:03.595
- I don't think there is a
single person that's successful

00:26:03.595 --> 00:26:06.432
