in the hard work.

00:26:06.432 --> 00:26:07.800
Which is the reverse
of the conversation.

00:26:07.800 --> 00:26:09.635
I just don't think that if you
put in the hard work you can

00:26:09.635 --> 00:26:11.937
necessarily be successful.

00:26:11.937 --> 00:26:15.307
There's nobody that's achieved
what you've achieved or what

00:26:15.307 --> 00:26:17.386
I've achieved that got 
there by accident and

00:26:17.386 --> 00:26:18.644
didn't put in the work.

00:26:18.644 --> 00:26:21.480
- How many entrepreneurs or
talented people have you met

00:26:21.480 --> 00:26:24.383
