this amazing office by the way

00:26:27.519 --> 00:26:30.689
that haven't made it
in a significant level?

00:26:30.689 --> 00:26:31.957
I don't know any.

00:26:31.957 --> 00:26:34.550
- First of all, nobody works 18
hours a day like I do but

00:26:34.550 --> 00:26:36.180
(laughter)

00:26:36.180 --> 00:26:39.164
