00:28:01.813 --> 00:28:05.358
- Last question before
I get really burning.

00:28:05.358 --> 00:28:08.762
I feel like I'm going to burn 
this table now but I love it.

00:28:08.762 --> 00:28:12.360
I love it because I love it
because I love, first of all, it's

00:28:12.360 --> 00:28:14.725
