00:28:24.803 --> 00:28:28.040
I believe in that but I think
that maximizes what you have.

00:28:28.040 --> 00:28:31.143
I think the work will maximize
what you have I just don't think

00:28:31.143 --> 00:28:32.044
everybody has it.

00:28:32.044 --> 00:28:33.378
Especially when
you get into art.

00:28:33.378 --> 00:28:36.221
When you get into music and 
sports and things of that nature

00:28:36.221 --> 00:28:39.103
I think that is a tough challenge.
Last question.

00:28:39.103 --> 00:28:41.687
- [Voiceover] Chris asks, 
"How do you girls stay so

