nothing happens that doesn't

00:29:06.345 --> 00:29:10.119
slide by our our dad or our mom
and they keep us in check and we

00:29:10.119 --> 00:29:13.418
keep each other in check.

00:29:13.418 --> 00:29:15.687
- And also not feeling entitled.

00:29:15.687 --> 00:29:19.057
I think that's something we
really surrounded by especially

00:29:19.057 --> 00:29:23.462
