interesting to watch.

00:30:48.380 --> 00:30:52.551
It is really to me the thing
that is most followed hip hop as

00:30:52.551 --> 00:30:54.753
a new genre that
didn't really exist before.

00:30:54.753 --> 00:30:58.523
I'm curious for you guys who 
are much closer to it,

00:30:58.523 --> 00:30:59.991
where is it in it's lifecycle?

00:30:59.991 --> 00:31:02.527
Just starting, hitting
an interesting time?

00:31:02.527 --> 00:31:04.796
It's become dramatically more
mainstream than it was

00:31:04.796 --> 00:31:05.831
five, six years ago.

00:31:05.831 --> 00:31:08.166
What is your
point of view on it?

00:31:08.166 --> 00:31:09.234
- I think it has plateaued.

00:31:09.234 --> 00:31:10.936
I think it's hit the climax--
- Okay.

00:31:10.936 --> 00:31:13.711
- I don't think it's
going anywhere, anytime soon.

00:31:14.631 --> 00:31:16.992
It just branched off in so 
many different directions.

00:31:16.992 --> 00:31:19.112
There's so many 
different sub-genres.

00:31:19.112 --> 00:31:20.915
There's new artist coming 
through every day.

00:31:20.915 --> 00:31:23.135
Guys likes Skrillex and
Diplo are doing a great job of

00:31:23.135 --> 00:31:24.971
