bringing them up through the

00:31:24.971 --> 00:31:28.920
system and there's the
difference between it now and

00:31:28.920 --> 00:31:33.058
what it was 15 years ago was how
much corporate backing it gets.

00:31:33.058 --> 00:31:34.926
You see with the brands
you work with all the time

00:31:34.926 --> 00:31:37.954
and how badly they want to be
involved with these entities and

00:31:37.954 --> 00:31:42.114
the biggest throwers of
festivals in the world, these

00:31:42.114 --> 00:31:45.504
biggest entertainment companies
in the world have put so much

00:31:45.504 --> 00:31:48.607
money into making sure that
it's going to stay where it is.

00:31:48.607 --> 00:31:50.774
Keep going with it.
- Ladies?

00:31:50.774 --> 00:31:53.089
- It's hard for me to comment
on this because I do feel like

00:31:53.089 --> 00:31:56.324
we've never quite
belonged in the EDM world--

00:31:56.324 --> 00:31:56.803
- Okay.

00:31:56.803 --> 00:32:00.283
- and so it's hard for me to
look at us as even still a part

00:32:00.283 --> 00:32:03.021
of it even though I know it's
kinda one foot in the door,

00:32:03.021 --> 00:32:04.512
one out for us.
- Okay.

00:32:04.512 --> 00:32:08.360
- We've always tried to maintain
our own lane while still, again,

00:32:08.360 --> 00:32:10.262
keeping one foot
in the EDM world.

00:32:10.262 --> 00:32:10.929
- I understand.

00:32:10.929 --> 00:32:14.432
- I think that that's probably a
good thing for us because like

00:32:14.432 --> 00:32:17.903
Jake said, I agree, I think it
has plateaued and we have this

00:32:17.903 --> 00:32:20.372
amazing opportunity to take
ourselves on a completely

00:32:20.372 --> 00:32:23.677
different lane and
pave our own way.

00:32:23.677 --> 00:32:26.893
- Do our own thing.
- Yeah, it's cool.

00:32:26.893 --> 00:32:28.513
- I just think a lot of what
were talking about when you're

00:32:28.513 --> 00:32:31.316
talking about depression with a
lot of young entrepreneurs--

00:32:31.316 --> 00:32:31.983
- Yes.

00:32:31.983 --> 00:32:34.686
- maybe feeling let down that
they can't really achieve the

